{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "03213",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.27,
      "end_seconds": 4.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "So, good morning. I've just opened your notes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 6.42,
      "end_seconds": 7.54,
      "duration_seconds": 1.12,
      "text": "Hi there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 9.3,
      "end_seconds": 10.93,
      "duration_seconds": 1.63,
      "text": "Where shall we begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.95,
      "end_seconds": 18.08,
      "duration_seconds": 5.13,
      "text": "Well, uh, I've been having shortness of breath."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.81,
      "end_seconds": 23.15,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "Can you tell me when it first started?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 25.2,
      "end_seconds": 41.04,
      "duration_seconds": 15.84,
      "text": "It's been about three months now. A neighbour of mine said I should see someone about it. I wasn't sure whether to come in at all, um, to be honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 46.36,
      "end_seconds": 60.93,
      "duration_seconds": 14.57,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse. These questions might sound routine, but they matter."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 61.85,
      "end_seconds": 65.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "It's worse with lying flat. Mostly mild."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 67.24,
      "end_seconds": 69.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "Any other symptoms with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 70.42,
      "end_seconds": 79.14,
      "duration_seconds": 8.72,
      "text": "A racing heart goes along with it, most of the time. The racing heart? That's been for two days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 80.36,
      "end_seconds": 83.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.59,
      "text": "Have you noticed fever, leg swelling or cough?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 84.91,
      "end_seconds": 88.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "No, I haven't had any of them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 89.19,
      "end_seconds": 91.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "Any muscle or joint problems besides this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 93.9,
      "end_seconds": 95.85,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "No, joints are fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 96.6,
      "end_seconds": 99.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "A few questions about your lifestyle now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 100.74,
      "end_seconds": 116.2,
      "duration_seconds": 15.46,
      "text": "I quit smoking around ten years ago. Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts. My husband and I live above the shop. I swim twice a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 134.24,
      "end_seconds": 136.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "Is there any regular medication you use?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.68,
      "end_seconds": 141.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "No, I'm not on anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.53,
      "end_seconds": 147.3,
      "duration_seconds": 4.77,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 149.29,
      "end_seconds": 152.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "No, I've always been fairly healthy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.0,
      "end_seconds": 156.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "Did you ever have any procedures done?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 157.76,
      "end_seconds": 163.07,
      "duration_seconds": 5.31,
      "text": "Yes, I had my septum straightened, in my thirties."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.77,
      "end_seconds": 168.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "So, before we go further, any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 172.58,
      "end_seconds": 176.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "I don't think I have any, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.83,
      "end_seconds": 192.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "Let's start with the basic checks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.3,
      "end_seconds": 206.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "Sit still for a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.55,
      "end_seconds": 220.22,
      "duration_seconds": 4.67,
      "text": "Okay: blood pressure 97 over 63, pulse 110, temperature 36.5."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.43,
      "end_seconds": 225.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "Let's move on to the examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.87,
      "end_seconds": 228.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "I'm just checking this side."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 236.16,
      "end_seconds": 243.78,
      "duration_seconds": 7.62,
      "text": "Your neck veins are swollen, the heart sounds are muffled and your blood pressure is low."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.63,
      "end_seconds": 250.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "Alright, you can relax now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 259.81,
      "end_seconds": 270.58,
      "duration_seconds": 10.77,
      "text": "Right, here's what I'm thinking. My working impression is possible cardiac tamponade. The reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 271.23,
      "end_seconds": 272.76,
      "duration_seconds": 1.53,
      "text": "Is this permanent?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 274.41,
      "end_seconds": 308.34,
      "duration_seconds": 33.93,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with possible cardiac tamponade do well once it's treated properly. I'm sending you for an urgent echocardiogram because of possible tamponade. You need an urgent heart scan and possibly a drain. Cut down on salt and fried food for now, it really does make a difference. Do get help quickly if the symptoms get worse. Let's plan a check straight away. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 310.36,
      "end_seconds": 313.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "I think I understand everything. Thanks."
    }
  ]
}